      "id": "COMP-002",
      "instruction": "Automatic zlib and bzip2 decompression starts at the larger of the shared capacity and 64 KiB. After an output-buffer-full result, each wrapper retries only while the next capacity is at most 4 MiB. Compression, however, first requests input_length + 1024 and the shared helper rounds that request upward without the 4 MiB ceiling.",
